37
00:06:48,888 --> 00:06:50,469
Bastards...

38
00:06:50,598 --> 00:06:52,554
Let's go, tetsuo!

39
00:06:52,683 --> 00:06:53,798
Right!

40
00:06:53,893 --> 00:06:55,303
Damn!

