"Pops"?!

152
00:19:05,207 --> 00:19:07,198
There was one more of us.

153
00:19:07,334 --> 00:19:08,334
What?

154
00:19:08,377 --> 00:19:09,617
Pardon me.

155
00:19:13,423 --> 00:19:14,708
What're you...

156
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:17,166
This is her. Can she leave with us?

157
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:19,876
