pattern growth process.

205
00:22:36,084 --> 00:22:37,745
All right. Continue.

206
00:22:37,836 --> 00:22:39,372
Very well, sir. Thank you.

207
00:22:39,588 --> 00:22:42,876
I'm sure he'll turn out to be a
worthy addition to the numbers.

208
00:22:44,634 --> 00:22:46,420
