410
00:38:09,683 --> 00:38:14,222
My job isn't to believe or disbelieve.
It's to act or not to act.

411
00:38:26,826 --> 00:38:27,861
Here, sir.

412
00:38:27,952 --> 00:38:31,740
Cold gear, colonel.
Please put it on. You, too, doctor.

413
00:38:43,551 --> 00:38:48,215
The other day, a young
researcher asked me something.

414
00:38:48,347 --> 00:38:52,386
He wondered if their power was the form the
next stage of human evolution was faking,

415
00:38:52,518 --> 00:38:57,012
and perhaps that well all
be able to control it someday.

416
00:38:58,107 --> 00:39:00,894
Scientists are a bunch of romantics.

417
00:39:00,985 --> 00:39:04,068
Military men always
