and science we had created,

445
00:41:18,080 --> 00:41:22,619
and shut the lid of the pandora's box
they themselves had opened.

446
00:41:27,131 --> 00:41:27,790
Ryu!

447
00:41:27,881 --> 00:41:30,122
Hey, we're still young.

448
00:41:30,217 --> 00:41:32,799
